      "primary_reasoning": "Phytone peptone and Phytone peptone (BD-BBL) denote the distinct Phytone scope; Soytone (BD-Difco) or Phytone peptone (BD-BBL) expresses alternatives. They cannot resolve as exact Soy_Peptone identity. FOODON03315720 is broader hydrolyzed vegetable protein. MICRO0000181 is a plausible exact-term candidate only for an established enzymatic soybean-flour digest scope. The generic source75 and1466 records do not establish method or manufacturer; some frozen source75 observations give example Soytone attributes, but do not define every generic observation. Manufacturer guide p7 permits acid/base/enzyme hydrolysis generally; p33 says its own soy products are enzymatic. This shows uncertainty, not positive evidence that source75 is nonenzymatic. The candidate expressly keeps an unspecified generic soy digest, so no forced exact181 assertion is warranted.",
